@KFC_HostAddress = http://localhost:5077

### Health check
GET {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Public catalogue
GET {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Is the AI assistant switched on?
GET {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/chat/status
Accept: application/json

### Ask the AI assistant (needs Chat__ApiKey set on the server)
POST {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "demo-session-0001", "message": "Which fruits are in season in summer?" }

### First-run only: create the first admin (refused once any admin exists)
POST {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "displayName": "Your Name", "password": "change-me-please" }

### Sign in - copy data.token from the response into @token below
POST {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "change-me-please" }

### Admin: list every item (needs a token)
@token = paste-token-here
GET {{KFC_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
